; Message's simple and extended forms, defined in
; Signal as types of their own. Design: section 1,
; Message's simple and extended forms.
Signal
[  flow_ethos:[ Address Request Lock Sender ] ]
[]
[]
[  Send.{                       ; simple: what a
      Recipient.[               ; flow writes
         Address.Address        ; the variant
                                ; carries the type
         Up ]                   ; the layer above in
                                ; the sender's aspect
      Request }
   Deliver.{                    ; extended: Message
      Lock                      ; to Flow, under the
      Sender                    ; lock; no flow id
      Request } ]
